  ('Cracking the PM Interview — companion site', 'Gayle McDowell and Jackie Bavaro''s PM interview material: role definitions, estimation, and the answer structures that work.', 'Interview Prep', 'https://www.crackingthepminterview.com/', ARRAY['product', 'interviews', 'books']::text[], NULL, '2026-08-06T00:00:00.000Z'),
